version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >
  Reproducible-research companion code for the manuscript "Constitutional AI
  Aligned Financial Decision Making: A Cross Benchmark Empirical Evaluation
  of Frontier LLMs and the AFIP Production Architecture." Implements the
  AFIP master orchestration algorithm, MODULE_SCHEMA definitions, and a
  paired-bootstrap plus Bonferroni-correction statistical evaluation
  harness.
